WEBVTT

00:02.350 --> 00:05.280
Today, we'll be using 
the herbs we all collected

00:05.280 --> 00:07.860
to make potions that'll 
increase your magic power.

00:07.860 --> 00:12.660
Castor began showing up in class 
after the incident in the forest.

00:12.660 --> 00:16.610
Man, it's so stuffy when there 
are so many guys around.

00:17.800 --> 00:20.950
I heard you can transform into a girl.

00:18.190 --> 00:20.460
What the hell are you doing, you idiot?!

00:20.950 --> 00:22.050
Switch, please?

00:20.980 --> 00:22.930
Don't eat that! Spit it out!

00:22.050 --> 00:24.880
Professor, is it okay if I kill him?

00:23.550 --> 00:26.180
Stop chewing!

00:24.880 --> 00:26.580
Not during class.

00:26.860 --> 00:31.830
Professor, I captured a boar. 
Is it all right if I add it to the pot?

00:31.830 --> 00:33.540
Take it back to the forest.

00:34.580 --> 00:38.020
But it looks like it'll take 
a while yet to get all these

00:38.020 --> 00:40.390
eccentric students on the same page.

00:40.390 --> 00:44.100
Professor, why don't we have a hot pot 
party, since we have everything we need?

00:44.680 --> 00:45.850
Sorry.

00:50.440 --> 00:51.610
What?

00:51.610 --> 00:53.030
Nothing.

00:54.480 --> 00:56.310
She seems down.

02:27.250 --> 02:31.450
I have magic training with Professor 
Claude after school every day.

02:31.910 --> 02:35.080
Virgo Magic: Anima!

02:37.430 --> 02:40.000
No good. It's too fast!

02:40.300 --> 02:41.380
Come on.

02:41.380 --> 02:43.210
The midterms are coming up.

02:43.500 --> 02:47.160
You're going to fail if you 
can't even catch a lophorn.

02:47.160 --> 02:48.680
But..

02:48.950 --> 02:52.560
It always detects my magic 
through its horns and gets away.

02:49.140 --> 02:49.890
ANIMA!

02:52.560 --> 02:54.980
Anima just isn't a good fit.

02:55.510 --> 02:58.280
If only I could use other magic...

02:58.280 --> 03:01.670
No, it's because you haven't 
fully grasped how to use Anima.

03:02.480 --> 03:04.450
What do you mean?

03:04.450 --> 03:08.990
A clever magician can find 
countless ways to use their magic.

03:09.400 --> 03:13.040
They can come up with innovative 
ways to work around their limits.

03:13.040 --> 03:15.970
That's what it means 
to be a good magician.

03:17.610 --> 03:20.390
That was a good quote, right? Right?!

03:20.390 --> 03:21.730
You should take notes.

03:21.730 --> 03:22.720
Annoying.

03:23.370 --> 03:27.180
But how do I innovate?

03:27.180 --> 03:27.930
Well...

03:28.250 --> 03:33.560
For example, Aquarius Magic allows you 
to manipulate water and change its form.

03:33.910 --> 03:36.440
Your ideas as a magician 
are what make it work.

03:37.100 --> 03:39.390
Aria's quite advanced.

03:39.390 --> 03:41.190
Why not ask her for advice?

03:42.100 --> 03:43.910
Wow, that's a disgusted look.

03:43.910 --> 03:47.480
Well, she's not going to 
teach me without complaining.

03:47.480 --> 03:49.480
Why not? You're friends.

03:49.480 --> 03:50.700
No, we aren't.

03:51.200 --> 03:52.350
We're enemies.

03:53.140 --> 03:56.080
Every time I got started on anything...

03:59.310 --> 04:01.790
I've never done this 
before, but it's so easy.

04:03.640 --> 04:05.300
Easy.

04:05.580 --> 04:07.880
You can use magic? Wow!

04:07.880 --> 04:09.870
You could get into Diana!

04:09.870 --> 04:11.600
Maybe I will.

04:11.600 --> 04:14.460
She's always better than me! 
She looks down on me!

04:14.460 --> 04:16.840
Just thinking about it pisses me off!

04:16.840 --> 04:18.240
Relax.

04:18.240 --> 04:20.210
You need to set aside your pride.

04:20.210 --> 04:22.490
Shouldn't you be doing 
everything you can right now?

04:23.130 --> 04:24.640
He's right.

04:24.640 --> 04:27.830
I have to get stronger.

04:28.280 --> 04:33.100
Pollux and Aria and them 
are all better than me.

04:33.100 --> 04:37.480
But I need to beat all of them 
if I'm going to be first-class.

04:42.250 --> 04:45.880
You want me to teach you the 
trick to using Aquarius Magic?

04:45.880 --> 04:48.130
I don't know... Should I?

04:48.130 --> 04:50.850
You don't want to, right? Thanks.

04:50.850 --> 04:52.800
Sure, I'll teach you.

04:52.800 --> 04:53.720
Really?!

04:53.720 --> 04:55.590
But only if...

04:55.590 --> 05:00.360
you do a puppy pose and look 
at me with sad puppy eyes

05:00.360 --> 05:05.940
and say, "Please teach me, Ms. Aria, 
arf," in a begging kind of way.

05:05.940 --> 05:07.970
Eww!

05:08.810 --> 05:11.420
She's just messing with me again!

05:11.420 --> 05:13.370
She doesn't think I can do it, does she?

05:13.370 --> 05:14.290
Well, she's wrong!

05:14.550 --> 05:17.370
This is nothing compared to the butt kiss!

05:18.780 --> 05:22.270
Please teach me, Ms. Aria, arf!

05:22.270 --> 05:24.000
Not embarrassing at all!

05:24.800 --> 05:25.830
Take that!

05:25.830 --> 05:28.620
Don't expect me to stay the 
same person I was before!

05:28.620 --> 05:30.470
Didn't expect that, Spica.

05:32.020 --> 05:34.740
Okay, I'll teach you. Come with me.

05:39.480 --> 05:41.520
That hits the spot.

05:41.520 --> 05:45.840
Hey, we've been in the 
bath for an hour now.

05:45.840 --> 05:47.820
What does this have to 
do with water magic?

05:47.820 --> 05:51.020
I guess you wouldn't notice, huh?

05:51.300 --> 05:56.610
Taking a bath stimulates your 
sympathetic nervous system

05:56.610 --> 05:59.560
and allows you to come 
up with versatile magic.

05:59.560 --> 06:00.620
Really?

06:00.620 --> 06:01.830
Kidding!

06:01.830 --> 06:05.480
I just wanted to take a bath. 
There's no point to this.

06:06.210 --> 06:08.730
You little...

06:08.730 --> 06:10.040
Are you mad?

06:10.040 --> 06:12.680
There's no particular trick to it, though.

06:12.940 --> 06:18.760
Aquarius Magic turns water into 
whatever shape you imagine.

06:18.760 --> 06:22.150
You observe and touch the forms you want

06:22.150 --> 06:25.400
and memorize their 
structures over and over.

06:34.470 --> 06:35.950
That's all it is.

06:36.460 --> 06:37.540
Boring, right?

06:38.280 --> 06:41.920
I always thought Aria was just a genius,

06:41.920 --> 06:44.580
but she's really worked 
hard to get this far.

06:45.390 --> 06:47.830
Thanks, Aria. I'll give it a try.

06:48.170 --> 06:50.950
Why are you trying so hard, anyway?

06:50.950 --> 06:54.090
I want to learn to catch lophorns.

06:54.090 --> 06:57.070
I was the only one who couldn't 
catch any in that last class.

06:57.530 --> 07:01.280
So you want your dear Claude's praise.

07:01.530 --> 07:02.320
Huh?

07:02.320 --> 07:06.490
Hey, wanna compete to 
see who can catch more?

07:06.490 --> 07:08.830
In a week, on the mountain.

07:08.830 --> 07:10.780
Why would we do that?

07:10.780 --> 07:12.950
That'll get you motivated, right?

07:12.950 --> 07:18.490
The loser has to become 
the winner's maid for a day.

07:19.480 --> 07:21.910
I have to win!

07:21.910 --> 07:24.020
What's wrong? Chickening out?

07:24.020 --> 07:24.950
What?

07:24.950 --> 07:27.810
You'd better have your maid outfit ready.

07:31.110 --> 07:33.990
Spica, wanna hit the town
 after school today?

07:33.990 --> 07:37.220
Sorry, I have remedial classes 
with Professor Claude.

07:37.220 --> 07:38.920
Again?

07:43.650 --> 07:45.890
She's so boring lately.

07:52.830 --> 07:57.650
Thus Spica began her training,
and in no time at all,

07:57.650 --> 07:59.860
the day of the contest arrived.

08:00.380 --> 08:03.710
We're seeing how many 
we can catch in an hour.

08:03.710 --> 08:04.660
Got it.

08:05.040 --> 08:08.680
You were just supposed to ask her 
for advice. Why are you competing?

08:08.680 --> 08:10.630
Do you think you can win?

08:11.430 --> 08:13.740
Just watch me.

08:13.740 --> 08:16.460
Behold the new skills I taught myself!

08:16.460 --> 08:17.630
New skills?

08:18.710 --> 08:21.110
All right, here we go.

08:21.110 --> 08:25.770
Aquarius Magic: Hand of Poseidon!

08:27.000 --> 08:28.690
Got five.

08:28.690 --> 08:30.930
That magic has such a wide area.

08:30.930 --> 08:33.150
She's as talented as ever.

08:33.150 --> 08:36.340
I guess I've already won.

08:36.340 --> 08:37.340
Done!

08:37.980 --> 08:43.250
Anima Transform: Human Catapult!

08:43.250 --> 08:44.960
What the hell? Wow!

08:44.960 --> 08:47.700
If it's going to detect my magic...

08:48.570 --> 08:51.200
I just need to use my 
own body to catch it!

08:52.530 --> 08:54.430
A-Are you all right?!

08:57.880 --> 08:59.480
Got one!

09:00.410 --> 09:02.460
You're already a total mess!

09:02.740 --> 09:04.780
You don't need to put 
your body on the line.

09:04.780 --> 09:05.930
I do.

09:06.340 --> 09:08.780
I don't want to lose.

09:10.090 --> 09:11.400
We're rivals.

09:15.290 --> 09:17.200
Rivals, she says.

09:20.280 --> 09:23.540
Spica 10, Aria 20.

09:23.850 --> 09:25.360
I lost.

09:25.360 --> 09:26.580
It's all right.

09:26.580 --> 09:29.920
You did your best, though, Spica.

09:30.240 --> 09:34.870
You know, I've been bored lately, 
since we haven't been hanging out.

09:35.630 --> 09:38.500
So I was looking forward to today.

09:38.500 --> 09:41.590
I never get bored of watching you.

09:44.990 --> 09:46.550
Let's play again.

09:47.670 --> 09:49.110
Aria...

09:51.650 --> 09:55.130
Let me guess. You love me, don't you?

09:55.130 --> 09:56.670
Exactly.

09:56.670 --> 09:58.910
So give me your attention.

09:58.910 --> 10:01.870
Think about me and only have eyes for me.

10:01.870 --> 10:03.340
Jeez!

10:02.600 --> 10:06.670
It's always nice having friends 
to raise each other up.

10:07.460 --> 10:11.850
Come on, put it in my mouth, my maid.

10:11.850 --> 10:14.310
Nope, I hate her!

10:21.010 --> 10:24.340
Where are you, my precious kitten?

10:24.340 --> 10:26.260
Come out.

10:26.260 --> 10:27.970
Let me nibble you forever!

10:28.400 --> 10:30.210
Kitten spotted!

10:30.210 --> 10:31.610
Wait for me!

10:30.210 --> 10:32.680
Damn it! Why is this happening?!

10:33.200 --> 10:35.650
One day earlier...

10:36.000 --> 10:39.290
Huh? We're choosing a 
leader for the coven?

10:39.290 --> 10:41.660
The leader is tasked with 
coordinating the members

10:41.660 --> 10:44.870
and dealing with errands and school 
events when the teacher is absent.

10:44.870 --> 10:46.900
Can you think of anyone you can nominate?

10:46.900 --> 10:49.920
Oh, a class rep.

10:50.680 --> 10:54.080
Well, I wouldn't mind doing it.

10:54.080 --> 10:56.240
Nah, not you.

10:56.240 --> 10:57.390
Why not?!

10:57.390 --> 11:00.550
The leader has to be a 
mature, responsible person.

11:01.110 --> 11:06.250
Long ago, one of the teachers chose 
a leader without much thought.

11:06.250 --> 11:08.440
The coven fell into disarray,

11:08.440 --> 11:12.300
the students turned on each other, 
and the class fell into chaos.

11:13.270 --> 11:16.110
That's how important it is 
to choose a good leader.

11:16.110 --> 11:19.110
Are you trying to say I'd cause 
the coven to fall into chaos?

11:19.110 --> 11:23.410
I don't know the others 
that well yet, though.

11:23.410 --> 11:25.730
You don't have any ideas yourself?

11:27.000 --> 11:31.250
I want to know how the students 
themselves see each other.

11:31.250 --> 11:33.970
In other words, you don't.

11:33.970 --> 11:37.890
Why not just observe 
their day-to-day activities?

11:37.890 --> 11:40.420
It's the weekend tomorrow, 
so they'll all be in the dorms.

11:40.420 --> 11:41.470
No!

11:41.470 --> 11:43.710
I want to spend the weekend 
being lazy in my room!

11:43.710 --> 11:45.130
What a lousy grown-up!

11:45.130 --> 11:48.040
Fine, I'll help you.

11:48.040 --> 11:49.850
If you insist.

11:49.850 --> 11:52.480
Why are you acting like 
I'm asking you for a favor now?!

11:52.720 --> 11:56.330
Well, then, meet at my 
place at ten tomorrow.

11:56.330 --> 11:57.590
Don't sleep in.

11:57.590 --> 11:59.060
I won't.

12:03.480 --> 12:04.650
She's late.

12:05.020 --> 12:06.920
It's already eleven.

12:06.920 --> 12:08.620
What is she up to?

12:11.440 --> 12:14.160
I can't even go back to 
being human without her.

12:14.160 --> 12:15.800
I guess I'll have to find her.

12:16.490 --> 12:18.850
I'm always in my room when I'm a cat.

12:18.850 --> 12:19.940
This feels new.

12:21.800 --> 12:23.690
It's a kitty!

12:23.690 --> 12:25.090
Merrow Pisces!

12:25.390 --> 12:28.760
You have such lovely ears.

12:28.760 --> 12:30.400
What's your name?

12:30.400 --> 12:31.260
Hey!

12:31.260 --> 12:32.790
Hey, put me down!

12:32.790 --> 12:35.050
What's that? Your name is Elizabeth?

12:35.050 --> 12:36.240
I never said that.

12:36.240 --> 12:37.870
I know!

12:37.870 --> 12:39.420
I have a gift for you, Elly!

12:39.420 --> 12:40.610
Come to my room!

12:44.440 --> 12:46.580
You're so adorable!

12:46.580 --> 12:47.860
Do you like that?

12:47.860 --> 12:49.140
This is humiliating!

12:49.140 --> 12:50.240
Elizabeth!

12:50.240 --> 12:53.370
She's too delusional to be a leader!

12:53.690 --> 12:55.500
Hang on. I might actually 
get a better chance

12:55.500 --> 12:58.280
to see the students being 
normal in this form.

13:01.200 --> 13:03.460
Chiron Sagittarius Aradia.

13:04.060 --> 13:06.180
Where'd this nasty-looking cat come from?

13:06.180 --> 13:08.880
I'm not nasty! You wanna go?!

13:06.820 --> 13:08.880
Do something, Tarf!

13:09.640 --> 13:10.890
There, there.

13:10.890 --> 13:11.870
Sorry about that.

13:11.870 --> 13:13.600
Chiron was really rude.

13:13.900 --> 13:15.650
Tarf Cancer.

13:15.650 --> 13:18.310
He's good at petting me.

13:18.570 --> 13:20.950
Maybe it's hungry.

13:20.950 --> 13:21.940
Bah.

13:22.700 --> 13:24.430
It's mine, but you can have the rest.

13:24.430 --> 13:28.630
Feeding the needy is a royal duty.

13:28.630 --> 13:31.620
Thank you, second prince of Aradia!

13:31.620 --> 13:33.890
Why don't we keep this cat in the dorm?

13:33.890 --> 13:36.900
Where I come from, cats are 
messengers of the gods.

13:36.900 --> 13:38.920
I'll give it a name, then.

13:38.920 --> 13:40.710
How about...

13:40.710 --> 13:42.610
Scroty McMegascrotum?

13:44.860 --> 13:46.000
Ow!

13:46.000 --> 13:47.540
What's wrong with that cat?!

13:47.540 --> 13:49.340
It ran away.

13:49.600 --> 13:51.550
I was expecting more of a prince.

13:51.550 --> 13:54.600
We can't have such a 
crude kid as the leader.

13:54.600 --> 13:56.340
I should hurry to Spica's room.

13:59.130 --> 14:00.980
Let me in, Spica.

14:03.930 --> 14:07.040
Shoot! This was Hana Sasorijou's room!

14:09.920 --> 14:11.500
Her room's terrifying!

14:12.810 --> 14:14.200
She won't say anything.

14:14.200 --> 14:15.170
What is this?

14:15.170 --> 14:16.540
What's going through her head?

14:17.030 --> 14:22.130
I've been making potions for 
my poison magic research.

14:22.130 --> 14:25.550
I need cat claws to put in.

14:25.550 --> 14:26.760
To put in?!

14:26.760 --> 14:28.110
Let me trim yours.

14:32.120 --> 14:33.780
What is this?!

14:33.780 --> 14:35.180
That's...

14:36.500 --> 14:38.330
What?! Let me go!

14:38.330 --> 14:41.240
That potion amplifies your sex pheromones.

14:41.240 --> 14:43.480
It causes you to attract other beings.

14:43.480 --> 14:45.590
It's a magic aphrodisiac.

14:45.590 --> 14:47.190
Why the hell are you making that?!

14:47.510 --> 14:48.370
Quit it!

14:48.370 --> 14:49.650
Get a grip!

14:49.650 --> 14:51.870
Sagittarius Magic!

14:51.870 --> 14:56.100
I can't let her be a leader when she's 
working on such dangerous magic.

14:56.100 --> 14:58.780
How do I get rid of this potion, though?

14:59.750 --> 15:03.680
Looking at that kitty 
is making my heart race.

15:03.680 --> 15:05.630
Such a naughty body.

15:05.630 --> 15:09.300
Be my very own pet, kitty.

15:09.300 --> 15:11.460
I want to eat you up!

15:13.170 --> 15:15.430
And this is how it began.

15:14.050 --> 15:16.720
Damn it! Why is this happening?!

15:17.750 --> 15:20.000
Submit to me!

15:18.530 --> 15:20.520
Let me fondle your paws.

15:20.520 --> 15:23.230
I wanna kiss you, kitty.

15:23.230 --> 15:24.940
I won't be caught!

15:28.440 --> 15:30.330
Capella Capricorn!

15:30.330 --> 15:31.780
Not you, too!

15:32.180 --> 15:34.440
Found you.

15:40.540 --> 15:42.320
You're scaring the cat.

15:42.320 --> 15:43.570
Get back!

15:45.870 --> 15:48.000
What is this sweet scent?

15:48.310 --> 15:50.440
My body feels tingly.

15:50.440 --> 15:51.550
Is this magic?

15:51.550 --> 15:53.110
I smell it from the cat.

15:53.110 --> 15:54.220
Crap!

15:54.630 --> 15:55.890
I see.

15:55.890 --> 15:59.170
It's this magic that's 
making everyone go crazy.

15:59.430 --> 16:01.590
But I won't let it get me!

16:02.220 --> 16:03.520
Badass!

16:03.990 --> 16:05.170
You, cat.

16:05.170 --> 16:06.490
What is she doing?!

16:06.490 --> 16:10.060
I'll eat that magic.

16:11.140 --> 16:12.490
Of course.

16:12.490 --> 16:14.600
Capricorn Magic could do it.

16:14.600 --> 16:18.330
My magic allows me to 
consume others' magic.

16:19.430 --> 16:21.660
What the hell was I doing?

16:19.880 --> 16:22.280
That'll rid you of the charm magic,

16:22.280 --> 16:23.920
as well as the spell everyone was under.

16:26.030 --> 16:29.380
You can always come to me for help, kitty.

16:29.750 --> 16:32.140
I-I found her!

16:32.140 --> 16:34.620
She's the one most fit to be the leader!

16:35.070 --> 16:37.450
Meanwhile, Spica had fallen back asleep.

16:37.450 --> 16:40.850
Not the butt! Not the butt!

16:43.040 --> 16:46.150
What? Me, the leader of the coven?

16:46.150 --> 16:47.330
Yeah.

16:47.330 --> 16:49.390
I think you'd be cut out for it.

16:49.390 --> 16:51.230
Why me?

16:51.230 --> 16:53.950
Because you're a mature, 
responsible person.

16:53.950 --> 16:55.660
Responsible...

16:56.250 --> 16:58.120
Professor, that's a taboo with her.

16:58.120 --> 16:58.810
Huh?

16:59.250 --> 17:01.140
Don't call me responsible!

17:01.140 --> 17:02.820
I'm disobedient!

17:02.820 --> 17:05.060
I'll break all the windows!

17:06.250 --> 17:09.680
Capella absolutely hates 
being called responsible.

17:09.680 --> 17:11.020
What the hell?!

17:11.020 --> 17:13.070
I'm bad!

17:13.070 --> 17:16.890
But being so responsible, 
she ended up accepting the job.

17:18.120 --> 17:19.830
Today, we'll be experimenting

17:19.830 --> 17:23.550
with different combinations 
of magic to see what happens.

17:24.180 --> 17:26.140
Water, coalesce!

17:26.140 --> 17:28.010
Aquarius Magic!

17:28.720 --> 17:31.140
Come out, my friends!

17:31.140 --> 17:32.970
Pisces Magic!

17:33.240 --> 17:34.270
Water Magic!

17:34.270 --> 17:35.670
Ocean Magic!

17:35.670 --> 17:37.440
Aquarium Sphere!

17:41.830 --> 17:44.680
So pretty! It's like an aquarium!

17:44.680 --> 17:46.650
I'm in the mood for some fish.

17:46.650 --> 17:47.710
I see.

17:48.040 --> 17:51.430
You use Aquarius Magic to 
gather water from the air,

17:51.430 --> 17:56.210
and Pisces Magic to summon aquatic 
animals and make an aquarium.

17:56.210 --> 18:00.570
I can't believe I don't need to be by the 
water to call on my friends anymore. Ooh!

18:01.040 --> 18:02.640
You're being bitten, though.

18:02.640 --> 18:04.180
It's just a love nibble.

18:04.570 --> 18:07.900
Now, everyone, form pairs and try it out.

18:07.900 --> 18:08.920
Pairs?!

18:08.920 --> 18:11.790
Who should I pair up with?

18:14.040 --> 18:15.430
Sasorijo.

18:15.810 --> 18:17.430
Want to team up?

18:17.430 --> 18:18.770
Why?

18:18.770 --> 18:21.500
Don't you know what my magic does?

18:21.500 --> 18:22.660
Of course.

18:22.990 --> 18:26.340
I saw you stunning all those lophorns.

18:26.340 --> 18:28.860
Poison magic seems really fun.

18:29.430 --> 18:31.080
"Fun"?

18:31.480 --> 18:32.650
Well?

18:32.650 --> 18:34.490
Why don't we pair up?

18:36.070 --> 18:39.260
I'd never join you.

18:40.710 --> 18:43.180
Um, I'm sorry! Was it something I said?

18:43.180 --> 18:45.230
I'm leaving class early. Ask someone else.

18:45.750 --> 18:47.680
D-Does she hate me?

18:47.680 --> 18:48.980
Why?

18:49.670 --> 18:51.850
Buck up, everyone.

18:52.180 --> 18:55.400
As you know, the midterms are tomorrow.

18:56.530 --> 18:59.820
For the exam, you'll be required to make 
it through a special dungeon using magic.

18:59.820 --> 19:01.190
There are dangers involved,

19:01.190 --> 19:03.830
and if you don't pass, you may 
not make it to the next year.

19:03.830 --> 19:07.280
Make use of everything you each 
learned over the past three months.

19:07.850 --> 19:09.870
Aim to become one of the 
top students of the year!

19:10.790 --> 19:12.850
It's here.

19:12.850 --> 19:14.950
My first exam at Diana!

19:16.990 --> 19:19.070
Done!

19:19.070 --> 19:20.460
I'm so hungry.

19:21.320 --> 19:22.760
Hey, Spica.

19:23.170 --> 19:25.680
There'll be no training 
after school today.

19:25.680 --> 19:27.160
Get some rest for tomorrow.

19:27.850 --> 19:28.890
Okay.

19:28.890 --> 19:30.030
Also...

19:31.290 --> 19:32.480
Break a leg.

19:37.610 --> 19:39.380
I want to prove to him...

19:39.380 --> 19:44.070
that all those times he trained 
with me weren't for nothing.

19:45.110 --> 19:46.980
Hey, Professor.

19:48.250 --> 19:51.530
I might not make it to the 
top of my year just yet,

19:51.530 --> 19:54.720
but I'll make it to the top of our coven.

19:56.940 --> 19:58.430
Are you sure?

19:58.430 --> 20:00.960
Hey, why are you reacting like that?

20:00.960 --> 20:04.630
I mean, what you say 
doesn't really pan out.

20:05.060 --> 20:07.120
Remember when we were 
looking for a leader?

20:07.120 --> 20:10.940
I told you not to sleep in, but you 
went right back to sleep in the morning.

20:10.940 --> 20:12.800
W-Well...

20:13.080 --> 20:15.030
It was a nightmare, you know.

20:15.030 --> 20:19.520
Merrow made me wear frilly clothes, 
Sasorijo nearly kissed me...

20:20.900 --> 20:22.270
Kissed you?

20:22.270 --> 20:25.690
Anyway, don't sweat it. 
Just do what you always do.

20:25.690 --> 20:27.170
That's what's best for you.

20:27.840 --> 20:28.960
Okay.

20:29.940 --> 20:32.840
I didn't expect that from Spica.

20:33.130 --> 20:35.850
She's become a little more dependable.

20:36.610 --> 20:39.100
What?! A kiss?!

20:39.100 --> 20:40.410
What happened?!

20:40.410 --> 20:42.160
Is she in love with him?

20:42.160 --> 20:45.040
Why does that make me feel so uneasy?

20:45.040 --> 20:48.180
I can't focus on my exam!

20:48.180 --> 20:51.000
What do I do?!

20:52.330 --> 20:53.400
Yes.

20:53.400 --> 20:56.250
Our midterms are starting tomorrow.

20:56.680 --> 20:59.090
So please tell Mother

20:59.540 --> 21:04.390
that I'll use my Scorpion Magic 
to make it to the top of my grade.

21:05.270 --> 21:07.510
Yes, miss.

21:07.510 --> 21:09.320
I wish you well.

21:14.790 --> 21:16.140
I have to.

21:17.890 --> 21:20.340
THE DAY OF THE EXAM

21:21.800 --> 21:24.170
Airships are so fantastic!

21:23.230 --> 21:24.750
I wanna go explore!

21:24.750 --> 21:26.940
Calm down. Stay seated.

21:26.940 --> 21:29.120
I guess exams aren't held at the school.

21:29.590 --> 21:33.050
So, the exam's in a dungeon, right?

21:33.050 --> 21:36.320
What if you get lost and 
end up stuck forever?

21:37.140 --> 21:39.160
Did you say something?

21:39.160 --> 21:40.400
Holy crap, your face!

21:40.750 --> 21:45.580
I told her to get some proper 
rest. Why is she so worn out?

21:46.400 --> 21:48.350
Huh? It's dark outside.

23:25.560 --> 23:27.750
We're fighting here for our exam?!

23:27.750 --> 23:30.400
And we have to get gold from 
deep inside the dungeon?!

23:30.400 --> 23:32.210
What's with this terrifying exam?!

23:32.210 --> 23:34.150
Next episode: "Midterms."

23:33.590 --> 23:40.050
EPISODE 6
MIDTERMS

23:34.150 --> 23:36.910
I'm escaping using Hermes' 
ring if I'm ever in trouble!

23:36.910 --> 23:38.910
You'll fail if you do that, though.
